00:14:46,380 --> 00:14:48,660
And if you don't know what the Lord of the Flies is,

242
00:14:48,660 --> 00:14:49,500
well, Google it,

243
00:14:49,500 --> 00:14:50,340
Look it up.

244
00:14:52,260 --> 00:14:54,780
But no, it's basically a story told

245
00:14:54,780 --> 00:14:57,060
about a group of boys

246
00:14:57,060 --> 00:14:58,740
who end up shipwrecked on an island

247
00:14:58,740 --> 00:15:00,300
and things don't go very well.

248
00:15:00,300 --> 00:15:02,420
Minutes after you've declared a yell for your zone,

249
00:15:02,420 --> 00:15:03,420
somebody's gonna yell.

250
00:15:05,500 --> 00:15:08,180
It's predictable, right?

251
00:15:08,180 --> 00:15:09,900
But don't jump all over them.

252
00:15:09,900 --> 00:15:11,780
Go back to square one

253
00:15:11,780 --> 00:15:13,339
and talk it through again

254
00:15:13,339 --> 00:15:15,540
and again, and again.

255
00:15:15,540 --> 00:15:18,900
Remember, we're looking for that voluntary obedience

256
00:15:18,900 --> 00:15:22,900
that is the mark of good, loyal citizenship.

257
00:15:22,900 --> 00:15:25,020
It's a rare commodity, isn't it?

258
00:15:25,020 --> 00:15:27,020
In nearly every other situations,

259
00:15:27,020 --> 00:15:28,860
your scouts find themselves

260
00:15:28,860 --> 00:15:33,579
in their under of regime of rules and punishments.

261
00:15:33,579 --> 00:15:36,100
Volunteering obedience is something new.

262
00:15:36,100 --> 00:15:38,060
It requires a lot of thinking

263
00:15:38,060 --> 00:15:40,260
and some real maturity on their part.

264
00:15:40,260 --> 00:15:43,700
And remember, yelling gets you compliance,

265
00:15:43,700 --> 00:15:46,380
but it doesn't get you voluntary obedience right.

266
00:15:46,380 --> 00:15:48,500
You can raise your voice when you need to,

267
00:15:48,500 --> 00:15:50,580
but we're not gonna yell at our scouts.

268
00:15:50,580 --> 00:15:55,580
["In the Mountain Greenery, Where God Beings the Seemery"].

269
00:15:55,939 --> 00:16:01,260
In the mountain greenery, where God Beings the Seemery.

270
00:16:01,260 --> 00:16:05,660
When it rains we'll have for the weather

