00:20:13,060 --> 00:20:16,060
because the Scouts will have to buy new, expensive equipment.

361
00:20:16,060 --> 00:20:18,060
Well, on backpacking, Bill,

362
00:20:18,060 --> 00:20:21,060
I would begin by shaping the experience

363
00:20:21,060 --> 00:20:23,060
to what the Scouts have now.

364
00:20:23,060 --> 00:20:25,060
Don't aim at backpacking trips

