00:20:44,060 --> 00:20:46,060
that never get used-

374
00:20:46,060 --> 00:20:48,060
And see if you can get things rolling that way.

375
00:20:48,060 --> 00:20:50,060
The idea is shaping the experience.

376
00:20:50,060 --> 00:20:52,060
that's easy, fun and encouraging

377
00:20:52,060 --> 00:20:55,060
for the first few times out on a backpacking trip.

378
00:20:55,060 --> 00:20:57,060
Now, if they really get into it,

379
00:20:57,060 --> 00:20:59,060
if they really like the idea of backpacking,

