390
00:21:20,060 --> 00:21:22,060
If you're going to go backpacking, go backpacking.

391
00:21:22,060 --> 00:21:24,060
Use what you got,

392
00:21:24,060 --> 00:21:26,060
Be adaptive and make it a short hike,

393
00:21:26,060 --> 00:21:28,060
Get the guys interested in it

394
00:21:28,060 --> 00:21:30,060
and then the gear follows

395
00:21:30,060 --> 00:21:32,060
And not really the other way around.

